    "description": "<p data-start=\"1715\" data-end=\"1813\" class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer\">At the beginning of each session, roll your Resonance Dice and place them on your character sheet.</p><p data-start=\"1815\" data-end=\"1874\">The number of Resonance Dice you roll depends on your Tier:</p><div class=\"group TyagGW_tableContainer\"><div tabindex=\"-1\" class=\"TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\"><table data-start=\"1876\" data-end=\"1975\" class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\"><thead data-start=\"1876\" data-end=\"1901\"><tr data-start=\"1876\" data-end=\"1901\"><th data-start=\"1876\" data-end=\"1883\" data-col-size=\"sm\" class=\"last:pe-10\"><p>Tier</p></th><th data-start=\"1883\" data-end=\"1901\" data-col-size=\"sm\" class=\"last:pe-10\"><p>Resonance Dice</p></th></tr></thead><tbody data-start=\"1928\" data-end=\"1975\"><tr data-start=\"1928\" data-end=\"1939\"><td data-start=\"1928\" data-end=\"1932\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><p>1</p></td><td data-start=\"1932\" data-end=\"1939\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><p>3d6</p></td></tr><tr data-start=\"1940\" data-end=\"1951\"><td data-start=\"1940\" data-end=\"1944\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><p>2</p></td><td data-start=\"1944\" data-end=\"1951\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><p>4d6</p></td></tr><tr data-start=\"1952\" data-end=\"1963\"><td data-start=\"1952\" data-end=\"1956\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><p>3</p></td><td data-start=\"1956\" data-end=\"1963\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><p>5d6</p></td></tr><tr data-start=\"1964\" data-end=\"1975\"><td data-start=\"1964\" data-end=\"1968\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><p>4</p></td><td data-start=\"1968\" data-end=\"1975\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><p>6d6</p></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div><p data-start=\"1977\" data-end=\"2009\">Each die may only be spent once.</p><p data-start=\"2011\" data-end=\"2044\">You may spend a <strong>Resonance Die</strong> to:</p><ul data-start=\"2046\" data-end=\"2186\"><li data-section-id=\"1y0tllv\" data-start=\"2046\" data-end=\"2080\"><p>Add its value to an <strong>Attack Roll</strong>.</p></li><li data-section-id=\"qhrv4e\" data-start=\"2081\" data-end=\"2114\"><p>Add its value to a <strong>Damage Roll</strong>.</p></li><li data-section-id=\"1iowshf\" data-start=\"2115\" data-end=\"2186\"><p>Spend <strong data-start=\"2123\" data-end=\"2133\">1 Hope</strong> to clear <strong data-start=\"2143\" data-end=\"2158\">1 Hit Point</strong> on a creature within Close range.</p></li></ul>",
